sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Agent
    participant Tool as search_agricultural_knowledge
    participant Hybrid as rag/retrievers.py (hybrid_search)
    participant Chroma as ChromaDB Vector Store
    participant BM25 as BM25Okapi Engine
    participant Verifier as rag/verifier.py (self_rag_verify)
    participant LLM as Groq LLM

    User->>Tool: search_agricultural_knowledge(query="canal buffer spray distance")
    Tool->>Hybrid: hybrid_search("canal buffer spray distance", top_k=3)
    Hybrid->>Chroma: Vector search (cosine similarity on all-MiniLM-L6-v2)
    Chroma-->>Hybrid: Vector document chunks
    Hybrid->>BM25: Keyword search on tokenized corpus
    BM25-->>Hybrid: BM25 top keyword chunks
    Hybrid->>Hybrid: Deduplicate & combine results (top_k=3)
    Hybrid-->>Tool: 3 merged knowledge chunks
    Tool->>Verifier: self_rag_verify(query, chunks, retrieved_text)
    Verifier->>LLM: Invoke structured VerificationResult(is_relevant, is_supported, reasoning)
    LLM-->>Verifier: VerificationResult(is_relevant=True, is_supported=True)
    Verifier-->>Tool: Verification confirmed
    Tool-->>User: "Retrieved Knowledge (Relevance Confirmed): [SOP-CHEM-4040: 15m canal buffer...]"
